<h3>HttpContext Demo</h3>
<p>Request Path: <strong>@ViewBag.Path</strong></p>
<p>Request Method: <strong>@ViewBag.Method</strong></p>
<p>User-Agent: <strong>@ViewBag.UserAgent</strong></p>
<p>Remote IP: <strong>@ViewBag.RemoteIp</strong></p>
<p>All values above were read directly from <code>HttpContext</code> in the controller.</p>